        "jsCode": "// Extract DM channel ID from POST /users/@me/channels response and persist.\nconst data = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst appealId = $('appeal-register').first().json.appealId;\nconst appeal = data.appeals?.[appealId];\nconst dm = $input.first().json;\nconst dmChannelId = dm?.id || null;\nif (appeal && dmChannelId) {\n  appeal.dmChannelId = dmChannelId;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ...$('appeal-register').first().json, dmChannelId } }];\n"
